1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,100
Bikin website pakai AI memang cepat,

2
00:00:02,220 --> 00:00:06,160
tapi jangan langsung merasa aman
cuma karena tampilannya sudah rapi.

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,700
Contohnya, kunci API
bisa bocor di kode publik,

4
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:12,200
belum lagi akses admin
nggak dibatasi,

5
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:14,100
dan input pengguna
nggak divalidasi,

6
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:15,350
itu celah keamanan.

7
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:17,000
Nah, save dulu biar nggak lupa,

8
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:19,700
dan follow buat tips
keamanan AI lainnya.

9
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:22,600
Sebelum website dirilis,
cek lagi tiga hal tadi,

10
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:25,350
kunci API, hak akses,
dan validasi input.

11
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,550
Jangan cuma percaya AI bilang beres,

12
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,700
harus tetap diuji sendiri!
